{"id":"collections","title":"Collections","category":"economy","icon":"minecraft:bundle","summary":"Gather items to climb collection tiers, earn coins, stats and recipes, and build up your SkyRPG Level.","blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"Collections count how much of each item you have gathered from the world. Every collection has nine tiers, and each tier pays coins and SkyRPG XP. Some tiers also give a small permanent stat, and some unlock Artisan Bench recipes. The "},{"x":"SkyRPG Level","b":true},{"x":" adds up everything you do in the game, and it is the number other players see next to your name in chat."}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"Open the page with "},{"x":"K","b":true},{"x":", then "},{"x":"Collections","b":true},{"x":"."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"How collections count","anchor":"how-collections-count"},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"A collection counts items you "},{"x":"gain from the world","b":true},{"x":":"}]},{"t":"ul","items":[{"s":[{"x":"Normal pickups from the ground, as long as no player threw or dropped them. Items you drop on death and pick up again do not count twice."}]},{"s":[{"x":"Blocks you mine with auto-pickup, and fishing and lava-fishing catches."}]},{"s":[{"x":"Harvests, logs and catches handled by the farming, foraging and fishing mods."}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"Items you buy, craft or take out of a chest do "},{"x":"not","b":true},{"x":" count, and neither do items another player drops or throws to you."}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"There are "},{"x":"63 collections","b":true},{"x":" in five categories: Mining, Farming, Foraging, Fishing and Combat."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"Tiers and rewards","anchor":"tiers-and-rewards"},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"Every collection has nine tiers, I to IX. Reaching a tier gives:"}]},{"t":"ul","items":[{"s":[{"x":"Coins.","b":true},{"x":" The amount depends on the collection. Rarer items pay more."}]},{"s":[{"x":"4 SkyRPG XP.","b":true}]},{"s":[{"x":"A stat","b":true},{"x":" at tier V (+1) and tier IX (+2 more), in the category's fortune stat for gathering collections. See the tables below."}]},{"s":[{"x":"Recipes","b":true},{"x":", for some collections. A locked recipe at the Artisan Bench shows \"Requires Coal Collection III\"."}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"You get a notice and a sound when you reach a tier. Hover a row on the page to see all nine tiers and what each gives."}]},{"t":"h3","text":"How big are the tiers?","anchor":"how-big-are-the-tiers"},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"Common items need a lot. Rare items need a little. As an example, the Wheat collection looks like this."}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Tier"}],[{"x":"Wheat gathered"}],[{"x":"Coins"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"I"}],[{"x":"100"}],[{"x":"100"}]],[[{"x":"II"}],[{"x":"200"}],[{"x":"250"}]],[[{"x":"III"}],[{"x":"500"}],[{"x":"500"}]],[[{"x":"IV"}],[{"x":"2,000"}],[{"x":"1,000"}]],[[{"x":"V"}],[{"x":"5,000"}],[{"x":"2,000"}]],[[{"x":"VI"}],[{"x":"10,000"}],[{"x":"4,000"}]],[[{"x":"VII"}],[{"x":"20,000"}],[{"x":"8,000"}]],[[{"x":"VIII"}],[{"x":"50,000"}],[{"x":"15,000"}]],[[{"x":"IX"}],[{"x":"100,000"}],[{"x":"30,000"}]]],"align":["l","l","l"]},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"Each collection follows the same shape. Stone is the cheapest (50 coins at tier I, 30,425 in all) and Leviathan Scale the dearest (400 coins at tier I, 243,400 in all)."}]},{"t":"h3","text":"Stats from collections","anchor":"stats-from-collections"},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Category"}],[{"x":"Stat at tier V, then tier IX"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"Mining"}],[{"x":"+1, then +2 Mining Fortune"}]],[[{"x":"Farming"}],[{"x":"+1, then +2 Farming Fortune"}]],[[{"x":"Foraging"}],[{"x":"+1, then +2 Foraging Fortune"}]],[[{"x":"Fishing"}],[{"x":"+1, then +2 Fishing Fortune"}]],[[{"x":"Combat"}],[{"x":"+1, then +2 of the stat in the table below"}]]],"align":["l","l"]},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"The two steps add up, so a finished collection gives +3 of its stat."}]},{"t":"h3","text":"Recipes that need a collection","anchor":"recipes-that-need-a-collection"},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"These Artisan Bench recipes need a collection tier as well as a skill level. See "},{"x":"Crafting","link":"crafting"},{"x":"."}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Recipe"}],[{"x":"Collection"}],[{"x":"Skill"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"Ironbark Hatchet","item":"skyrpg_items:ironbark_hatchet","icon":"skyrpg_items:ironbark_hatchet","color":"#55FF55"}],[{"x":"Ironbark II"}],[{"x":"Foraging 8"}]],[[{"x":"Skyiron Pickaxe","item":"skyrpg_items:skyiron_pickaxe","icon":"skyrpg_items:skyiron_pickaxe","color":"#5555FF"}],[{"x":"Skyiron III"}],[{"x":"Mining 18"}]],[[{"x":"Sunreaper Scythe","item":"skyrpg_items:sunreaper_scythe","icon":"skyrpg_items:sunreaper_scythe","color":"#5555FF"}],[{"x":"Sunwheat III"}],[{"x":"Farming 18"}]],[[{"x":"Mistpine Splitter","item":"skyrpg_items:mistpine_splitter","icon":"skyrpg_items:mistpine_splitter","color":"#5555FF"}],[{"x":"Mistpine III"}],[{"x":"Foraging 18"}]],[[{"x":"Duskbore Pick","item":"skyrpg_items:duskbore_pick","icon":"skyrpg_items:duskbore_pick","color":"#5555FF"}],[{"x":"Duskquartz III"}],[{"x":"Mining 26"}]],[[{"x":"Frostbite Scythe","item":"skyrpg_items:frostbite_scythe","icon":"skyrpg_items:frostbite_scythe","color":"#AA00AA"}],[{"x":"Frostberry III"}],[{"x":"Farming 26"}]],[[{"x":"Abyssal Rod","item":"skyrpg_items:abyssal_rod","icon":"skyrpg_items:abyssal_rod","color":"#AA00AA"}],[{"x":"Tidescale IV"}],[{"x":"Fishing 26"}]],[[{"x":"Emberheart Pickaxe","item":"skyrpg_items:emberheart_pickaxe","icon":"skyrpg_items:emberheart_pickaxe","color":"#AA00AA"}],[{"x":"Emberite III"}],[{"x":"Mining 35"}]],[[{"x":"Magmaline Rod","item":"skyrpg_items:magmaline_rod","icon":"skyrpg_items:magmaline_rod","color":"#FFAA00"}],[{"x":"Magma Fish III"}],[{"x":"Fishing 40"}]],[[{"x":"Lumen Breaker","item":"skyrpg_items:lumen_breaker","icon":"skyrpg_items:lumen_breaker","color":"#FFAA00"}],[{"x":"Lumenite III"}],[{"x":"Mining 45"}]]],"align":["l","l","l"]},{"t":"h2","text":"All collections","anchor":"all-collections"},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"The thresholds are the number of items you must have gather